# Coulsy Fire Doors — Netlify redirects
#
# Manchester page was never a real location but sits in Google's index
# with ~1,500 impressions/yr. Send to the regional services page so any
# residual clicks land somewhere relevant instead of 404.
/manchester-fire-door-services  /yorkshire-fire-door-services  301!

